   "widgets_values": [
    "integrated_multimodal_description:\n\n[Shot 1] 2d anime style, extreme low-angle close shot of a porcelain-skinned female warrior with long silver-white hair and straight bangs standing motionless on a ruined stone battlefield. She wears a flowing white robe with intricate gold embroidery and light metallic armor accents. Dark ruins and faint ancient runes disappear into cold fog behind her. In the first instant she launches forward at impossible speed. The stone beneath her feet fractures in sequence as debris explodes backward. Her hair and robe snap straight behind her from the acceleration. She draws her Tachi mid-sprint; the blade ignites with concentrated crimson energy, filling the frame with a sharp red flash.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the camera cuts to a low tracking shot moving beside her. Enemy blades narrowly cross her path. She slips between them without slowing, leaving stylized anime afterimages. She performs three readable attacks in rapid succession: a horizontal cut, an upward slash, then a spinning finishing strike. Each movement leaves a crisp crimson sword trail. Armor splits apart a fraction of a second after the blade passes, followed by sparks, fragments, and hand-drawn impact frames. Cut as she lands in a low stance with the glowing Tachi held behind her.\n\noverall_soundscape:\n\nSharp Tachi unsheathing, cracking stone, high-speed movement bursts, metallic clashes, slicing air, and debris impacts synchronized tightly to each strike, ending on a short ringing blade hum.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\n\nFast dark orchestral-anime battle score driven by aggressive taiko-style percussion, low strings, and short distorted electronic pulses.",
