   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "H3 hires (see the ResCascade README). Render at 1 MP, where H3 decides motion, acting and detail well; H3 Hires Fix upscales the latent with LBH-123-AI's 3D net and redraws only lines/texture at the target size (sigma 0.45 -> 0). The refine runs on DMAD 0.8 in 2 steps: turbo is free here because the take is already fixed (in pass 1 it changes the take and the audio). TT punch 1920x1088: ~230 s vs 492 s native. Without DMAD: wire the pass-1 model and set steps_override 0 (4 base steps, ~70 s more, same look). Keeps the 1 MP take and its audio exactly. Needs ComfyUI-H3-ResCascade + LBH weights in models/latent_upscale_models."
   ]
  }
